    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to big game\nhunting authorization for the county of Onondaga; and providing for the repeal\nof such provisions upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S6125",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6125-2023",
